-- program-of m c fuel: (refused , definitions). definitions: the entry and every definition
-- reachable from it that quotes, each (g , code); refused: those that do not, each (g , verdict).
-- Whether a definition is in the fragment is decided after the encoder's passes have removed what
-- no result depends on (lib/x86.cub): a proof argument's code may use composition and never be
-- computed
prog-run : Word → Prog → Lst (Word × Verdict) × Lst (Word × Code)
prog-run fuel st = (let r = w-iter fuel prog-step st in (snd (snd (snd r)) , fst (snd (snd r))))
